{"id":"117d071027580882","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment.md","title":"数实现性的无量词算术片段","display":"df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment — 数实现性的无量词算术片段","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment","aliases":["72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment"],"display":"df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment — 数实现性的无量词算术片段","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §1.4–1.10 print413–415/PDF425–427; local decidable fragment","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment — 数实现性的无量词算术片段"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §1.4–1.10 print413–415/PDF425–427; local decidable fragment"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a\\)</span> 为本册数实现性的自由算术语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_a\">\\(q_a\\)</span> 按公式树递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_a(t=_as):=q_a(\\bot_a):=0,\\qquad\nq_a(A\\circ B):=\\max(q_a(A),q_a(B)),\\qquad\nq_a(\\forall_ax_iA):=q_a(\\exists_ax_iA):=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_a(t=_as):=q_a(\\bot_a):=0,\\qquad\nq_a(A\\circ B):=\\max(q_a(A),q_a(B)),\\qquad\nq_a(\\forall_ax_iA):=q_a(\\exists_ax_iA):=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_a:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_a:q_a(A)=0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal Q_a:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_a:q_a(A)=0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里允许原始析取；与既有负片段既不相同也不互相包含：负片段允许全称，无量词片段允许析取。q 在任一量词节点直接取1，故它能检测到任意深度的量词出现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land_a,\\lor_a,\\to_a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q_a","display":false},{"tex":"q_a(t=_as):=q_a(\\bot_a):=0,\\qquad\nq_a(A\\circ B):=\\max(q_a(A),q_a(B)),\\qquad\nq_a(\\forall_ax_iA):=q_a(\\exists_ax_iA):=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal Q_a:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_a:q_a(A)=0\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1427,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba4958